{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a240f23c-e0fe-8295-b9f3-b8d97d5d99c0",
  "created_at": "2025-12-16T14:28:36-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Aisha Patel",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:27:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities, water and sewer billing, this is Tony. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:27:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Tony, good afternoon. I am calling for my mother, she is eighty-one. Her water bill came and it is, um, much too high. Honestly, it is not right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:27:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can look at that. Which account are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:27:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The one on, wait. I have two properties, hers and mine, and the papers are all together here. [pause] Sorry, this one is mine. Hers is the other envelope."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:27:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. Read me the account number off the one for your mom."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:27:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, yes, this one. It says the usage is double from last quarter. For a woman living alone. Is there any discount, for elderly, or low income? She is on a small pension."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:28:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can send you the assistance information for seniors, and we'll flag the reading for a recheck too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:28:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, thank you. And can she pay on a Saturday or Sunday? I work all week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:28:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Office is closed weekends, but there's a drop box outside City Hall, and you can pay online anytime."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:28:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Online, okay. Before, people just walked in, no calling. Now everything is a computer. Anyway, thank you, Tony."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-16T14:28:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happy to help. Take care."
    }
  ],
